       "key": {
        "en": "The most effective response is proactive, transparent, within your authority, and solves the problem; rank with that filter.",
        "id": "Respons paling efektif itu proaktif, transparan, dalam wewenangmu, dan menyelesaikan masalah. Urutkan pilihan dengan saringan itu."
       }
